  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi></math> is not one-one.<br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;to be real, <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />and <math><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8834;</mo><mi>R</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi></math> is not onto",
